the All-Mighty","transliteration":"l-ʿazīzu","lemma":"عَزِيز","root":"عزز","entryId":"l-da1ac3fcbe3eed57"},{"key":"62:3:8","position":8,"arabic":"ٱلْحَكِيمُ","kind":"word","gloss":"the All-Wise","transliteration":"l-ḥakīmu","lemma":"حَكِيم","root":"حكم","entryId":"l-a583e31fa7264499"},{"key":"62:3:9","position":9,"arabic":"٣","kind":"end-marker","gloss":"","transliteration":"","lemma":null,"root":null,"entryId":null}]},{"ref":"62:4","translation":"That is the Grace of Allâh, which He bestows on whom He wills. And Allâh is the Owner of Mighty Grace.","translationSource":"qul-301-hilali-khan","notes":[],"tokens":[{"key":"62:4:1","position":1,"arabic":"ذَٰلِكَ","kind":"word","gloss":"That","transliteration":"dhālika","lemma":"ذَٰلِك","root":null,"entryId":"l-096a9ad382db7640"},{"key":"62:4:2","position":2,"arabic":"فَضْلُ","kind":"word","gloss":"(is the) Bounty","transliteration":"faḍlu","lemma":"فَضْل","root":"فضل","entryId":"l-b99133c7988741eb"},{"key":"62:4:3","position":3,"arabic":"ٱللَّهِ","kind":"word","gloss":"(of) Allah","transliteration":"l-lahi","lemma":"اللَّه","root":"اله","entryId":"l-4b28e3627200a6c3"},{"key":"62:4:4","position":4,"arabic":"يُؤْتِيهِ","kind":"word","gloss":"He gives it","transliteration":"yu'tīhi","lemma":"آتَى","root":"اتي","entryId":"l-45664741cd653ab4"},{"key":"62:4:5","position":5,"arabic":"مَن","kind":"word","gloss":"(to) whom","transliteration":"man","lemma":"مِن","root":null,"entryId":"l-9235e02e84a628b3"},{"key":"62:4:6","position":6,"arabic":"يَشَآءُ ۚ","kind":"word","gloss":"He wills","transliteration":"yashāu","lemma":"شَآءَ","root":"شيا","entryId":"l-e6061b9230d95354"},{"key":"62:4:7","position":7,"arabic":"وَٱللَّهُ","kind":"word","gloss":"And Allah","transliteration":"wal-lahu","lemma":"اللَّه","root":"اله","entryId":"l-4b28e3627200a6c3"},{"key":"62:4:8","position":8,"arabic":"ذُو","kind":"word","gloss":"(is the) Possessor","transliteration":"dhū","lemma":"ذُو","root":null,"entryId":"l-ea5c5c22a86c9f67"},{"key":"62:4:9","position":9,"arabic":"ٱلْفَضْلِ","kind":"word","gloss":"(of) Bounty","transliteration":"l-faḍli","lemma":"فَضْل","root":"فضل","entryId":"l-b99133c7988741eb"},{"key":"62:4:10","position":10,"arabic":"ٱلْعَظِيمِ","kind":"word","gloss":"the Great","transliteration":"l-ʿaẓīmi","lemma":"عَظِيم","root":"عظم","entryId":"l-4ac2f032da29eeff"},{"key":"62:4:11","position":11,"arabic":"٤","kind":"end-marker","gloss":"","transliteration":"","lemma":null,"root":null,"entryId":null}]},{"ref":"62:5","translation":"The likeness of those who were entrusted with the (obligation of the) Taurât (Torah) (i.e. to obey its commandments and to practise its laws), but who subsequently failed in those (obligations), is as the likeness of a donkey which carries huge burdens of books (but understands nothing from them). How bad is the example of people who deny the Ayât (proofs, evidence, verses, signs, revelations) of Allâh. And Allâh guides not the people who are Zâlimûn(polytheists, wrong-doers, disbelievers).","translationSource":"qul-301-hilali-khan","notes":[],"tokens":[{"key":"62:5:1","position":1,"arabic":"مَثَلُ","kind":"word","gloss":"(The) likeness","transliteration":"mathalu","lemma":"مَثَل","root":"مثل","entryId":"l-b67e1c19ddcf5a93"},{"key":"62:5:2","position":2,"arabic":"ٱلَّذِينَ","kind":"word","gloss":"(of) those who","transliteration":"alladhīna","lemma":"الَّذِى","root":null,"entryId":"l-5016cb590bd9088a"},{"key":"62:5:3","position":3,"arabic":"حُمِّلُوا۟","kind":"word","gloss":"were entrusted","transliteration":"ḥummilū","lemma":"حُمِّلَ","root":"حمل","entryId":null},{"key":"62:5:4","position":4,"arabic":"ٱلتَّوْرَىٰةَ","kind":"word","gloss":"(with) the Taurat","transliteration":"l-tawrāta","lemma":"تَّوْرَىٰة","root":null,"entryId":null},{"key":"62:5:5","position":5,"arabic":"ثُمَّ","kind":"word","gloss":"then","transliteration":"thumma","lemma":"ثُمّ","root":null,"entryId":"l-75b66396af12da75"},{"key":"62:5:6","position":6,"arabic":"لَمْ","kind":"word","gloss":"not","transli